{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/6c288565032d4e5651c881f1ea96ae59.poster.avif?t=1772020717\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/6c288565032d4e5651c881f1ea96ae59.webm?t=1772020717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/6c288565032d4e5651c881f1ea96ae59.mp4?t=1772020717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><u>What is Necrosis: Dawn of Dread?</u></strong><br><br><strong><u></u></strong><br><br><i>Necrosis: Dawn of Dread</i> is a tense, brutal, and unforgiving first-person shooter co-op survival horror experience that blends the claustrophobic dread of old-school 90's era survival horror games with modern gameplay mechanics. Team up with up to three friends in online multiplayer to scavenge supplies, survive relentless combat encounters, and solve challenging puzzles in one of 15 unique missions overwhelmed by the undead. Every mission is a desperate fight to survive with hardcore character interdependence, inventory management, and finely tuned pacing.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/797fa701831d25d58e34f67c0af86ffc.poster.avif?t=1772020717\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/797fa701831d25d58e34f67c0af86ffc.webm?t=1772020717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/797fa701831d25d58e34f67c0af86ffc.mp4?t=1772020717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terrifying Co-op Survival Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic survival horror from a new angle. NDOD drops you into large, unpredictable environments filled with relentless enemies, dwindling resources, and no guarantees. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical FPS Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited ammo, choose your shots carefully, and master a variety of weapons. NDOD rewards precision and teamwork. Reckless shooting will only get you killed.\u00a0Unlike arcade-style zombie shooters, NDOD doesn\u2019t hand you infinite ammo and disposable enemies. Necrosis is survival horror. Precise, punishing, and built around dread.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve layered, interactive puzzles that challenge your observation and deduction skills. These are designed to keep you thinking and actively involved in every mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Twelve Unique Survivors + Many Unlockable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your squad from a roster of twelve distinct survivors, each with a unique role and special ability. Melee takedowns, crowd control, healing, enemy debuffs, stuns, team buffs, starting gear, and more. Every character has a unique weapon. Mix and match characters to find the ideal team synergy. Unlock additional <strong>secret characters</strong> as you progress, each bringing new tactics and surprises to your survival toolkit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Large Replayable Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fifteen unique environments inspired by survival horror classics, NDOD is built to be played again and again. Each map is packed with atmosphere, danger, and secrets waiting to be discovered. In some missions, you\u2019ll even rely on cars or motorcycles in desperate bids for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Randomized Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two sessions are the same. Enemy placements, item locations, and some puzzles change each time you play. The experience stays fresh no matter how often you return.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Session-based design means you can drop in for a quick run or settle in for a night of survival. Perfect for both casual and hardcore co-op players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatcher Queue</strong> \u2013 Match with other survivors and use proximity VOIP or text chat to coordinate your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player Mode</strong> \u2013 Play solo if you prefer, but NDOD is best experienced in co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Difficulty Settings -</strong>\u00a0Choose your ideal level of challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Unlockables</strong> \u2013 No microtransactions. Unlock cosmetics and rewards through gameplay, not payments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete for the fastest clears and prove your survival skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long-Term Roadmap</strong> \u2013 Additional levels, characters, and enemies planned post-launch: All free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No DRM. No Third-Party Accounts.</strong> \u2013 Just buy the game and play. No logins, no restrictions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built with Respect for Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necrosis: Dawn of Dread is developed independently with a focus on player-first design. No microtransactions. No always-online requirement. No corporate interference. Just uncompromising co-op survival horror built for fans of the genre. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/85876790fcb6b0e577db4e02ea971361.poster.avif?t=1772020717\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/85876790fcb6b0e577db4e02ea971361.webm?t=1772020717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/85876790fcb6b0e577db4e02ea971361.mp4?t=1772020717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Police Station Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155010/47a0c3fda9fb7b37008c786927f2a0cf590ccd33.jpg"},{"name":"Hospital Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155010/73fa97ed309f4dc53583c7d38c4d399d11e0cc01.jpg"},{"name":"Hotel Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155010/06f78b742853c81d2a215149f8e6663de3df00af.jpg"},{"name":"Lab Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155010/8b426d2f251589e6ca01d779a148359e6f63d137.jpg"},{"name":"Mall Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155010/7fd112f9e4d8d6ec5fd5978b1c317eecbd0b54c8.jpg"},{"name":"Mansion Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155010/006ebb7f42d177b8f237164c9d0cb3de71a84b0f.jpg"},{"name":"Trailer Park Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155010/bab9505800c546ca1c8e3e3311473d1cf5b4a4ca.jpg"},{"name":"Train Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155010/7c3f94098fdc244b9b55930cb1ebc7a2067b3f01.jpg"},{"name":"Training Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155010/9114f0b42ab9e14dabe758ff61eeba04311ffd34.jpg"},{"name":"Road Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155010/95544251c2326e3ac3b386bd036ae95f6612f9ab.jpg"}],"total":72},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3155010?t=1772020717","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/dfc8b7d0937afb7e3688d29d2c633993d1776e66/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772020717","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/efe4322479d403b3c35d741fe93f9305dd0930b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772020717","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/efe4322479d403b3c35d741fe93f9305dd0930b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772020717","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/6c288565032d4e5651c881f1ea96ae59.poster.avif?t=1772020717\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/6c288565032d4e5651c881f1ea96ae59.webm?t=1772020717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/6c288565032d4e5651c881f1ea96ae59.mp4?t=1772020717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><u>What is Necrosis: Dawn of Dread?</u></strong><br><br><strong><u></u></strong><br><br><i>Necrosis: Dawn of Dread</i> is a tense, brutal, and unforgiving first-person shooter co-op survival horror experience that blends the claustrophobic dread of old-school 90's era survival horror games with modern gameplay mechanics. Team up with up to three friends in online multiplayer to scavenge supplies, survive relentless combat encounters, and solve challenging puzzles in one of 15 unique missions overwhelmed by the undead. Every mission is a desperate fight to survive with hardcore character interdependence, inventory management, and finely tuned pacing.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/797fa701831d25d58e34f67c0af86ffc.poster.avif?t=1772020717\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/797fa701831d25d58e34f67c0af86ffc.webm?t=1772020717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/797fa701831d25d58e34f67c0af86ffc.mp4?t=1772020717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terrifying Co-op Survival Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic survival horror from a new angle. NDOD drops you into large, unpredictable environments filled with relentless enemies, dwindling resources, and no guarantees. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical FPS Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited ammo, choose your shots carefully, and master a variety of weapons. NDOD rewards precision and teamwork. Reckless shooting will only get you killed.\u00a0Unlike arcade-style zombie shooters, NDOD doesn\u2019t hand you infinite ammo and disposable enemies. Necrosis is survival horror. Precise, punishing, and built around dread.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve layered, interactive puzzles that challenge your observation and deduction skills. These are designed to keep you thinking and actively involved in every mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Twelve Unique Survivors + Many Unlockable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your squad from a roster of twelve distinct survivors, each with a unique role and special ability. Melee takedowns, crowd control, healing, enemy debuffs, stuns, team buffs, starting gear, and more. Every character has a unique weapon. Mix and match characters to find the ideal team synergy. Unlock additional <strong>secret characters</strong> as you progress, each bringing new tactics and surprises to your survival toolkit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Large Replayable Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fifteen unique environments inspired by survival horror classics, NDOD is built to be played again and again. Each map is packed with atmosphere, danger, and secrets waiting to be discovered. In some missions, you\u2019ll even rely on cars or motorcycles in desperate bids for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Randomized Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two sessions are the same. Enemy placements, item locations, and some puzzles change each time you play. The experience stays fresh no matter how often you return.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Session-based design means you can drop in for a quick run or settle in for a night of survival. Perfect for both casual and hardcore co-op players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatcher Queue</strong> \u2013 Match with other survivors and use proximity VOIP or text chat to coordinate your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player Mode</strong> \u2013 Play solo if you prefer, but NDOD is best experienced in co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Difficulty Settings -</strong>\u00a0Choose your ideal level of challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Unlockables</strong> \u2013 No microtransactions. Unlock cosmetics and rewards through gameplay, not payments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete for the fastest clears and prove your survival skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long-Term Roadmap</strong> \u2013 Additional levels, characters, and enemies planned post-launch: All free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No DRM. No Third-Party Accounts.</strong> \u2013 Just buy the game and play. No logins, no restrictions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built with Respect for Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necrosis: Dawn of Dread is developed independently with a focus on player-first design. No microtransactions. No always-online requirement. No corporate interference. Just uncompromising co-op survival horror built for fans of the genre. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/85876790fcb6b0e577db4e02ea971361.poster.avif?t=1772020717\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/85876790fcb6b0e577db4e02ea971361.webm?t=1772020717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/85876790fcb6b0e577db4e02ea971361.mp4?t=1772020717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mike Schroder","Swole Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/c2e163497a1293ecafa24bab854489d7751a7526/header.jpg?t=1772020717","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155010/1919190098/236a8f585acf70c20d73c1732f3f5670aa033f77/1771993979/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772020714","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155010/1919190098/236a8f585acf70c20d73c1732f3f5670aa033f77/1771993979/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772020714","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155010/1919190098/236a8f585acf70c20d73c1732f3f5670aa033f77/1771993979/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772020714","id":257294090,"name":"Creator Showcase Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257294090/b1a0f3605e9ca53fa82b8b86a284e9e44fb7a1ff/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772020714"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155010/150368223/bc868a0b52bf11fddb466050230eb3f182b148af/1769471576/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769723718","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155010/150368223/bc868a0b52bf11fddb466050230eb3f182b148af/1769471576/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769723718","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155010/150368223/bc868a0b52bf11fddb466050230eb3f182b148af/1769471576/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769723718","id":257272288,"name":"Streamer Highlights","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257272288/04ba3278f3765b79e2acd798419cbb90216fd4a6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=17